; Logical Constant : ONE scalar value — a true RANK-0 tensor (shape is
; the empty list), never a length-1 vector (user ruling 2026-07-22).
; Full-sized constant tensors are broadcast VIEWS of this: the empty
; index map (IndexMapLit (IntExprNil)) applied at the target shape.
; Congruence dedupes: every (LogicalConstant 1.5) in a program IS one
; e-class. F32 by the dtype rule (luminal parity).
(constructor LogicalConstant (f64) LogicalTensor)
